icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PlotVitalNPC</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1237544-2e-what-happens-if-i-make-and-drink-chalcanth-from-a-jouten?p=1237620#post1237620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If it was Hegra's cloud jouten, is it a really <i>good</i> trip?</div> </div> </div> </div>No. The Typhoon of Nightmares is, uh....well, the name sorta speaks for itself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T13:12:41-07:00","id":1238340,"title":"","content":"If it's the Ebon Dragon I think you get a Diet Chalcanth. Looks and smells like Chalcanth. No real substance though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/979-jam-in-a-jar","name":"Jam in a jar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T20:10:19-07:00","id":1242584,"title":"","content":"I think anything is possible. I might rule that turning a joutun into chalcanth might prevent them from becoming neverborn, a way to permanently get rid of the yozi. But if you drink it straight? Probably not much, other than kill you. It's the raw essence of pure creation. But you COULD use it to forge something awesome, like new Exalted from the distilled essence of Malfeas, without the whole infernal hang-up. Or make some kind of super-golem......who'd probably retain some memories and in 1000 years would come back for revenge.....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24418-dracheau","name":"Dracheau","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T14:22:27-07:00","id":1242787,"title":"","content":"Strictly speaking, you can't drink Chalcanth from a Jouten, because Vitriol turns demons into Chalcanth, and Jouten aren't demons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}